 "note": "D363: the cost lines on D362's A2 (unchanged, [ID] to 1e-9) -- PUB / PB as D362, EW (three-bar windows around the gap and the exit) and EW1 (the single pair) from the record's own Corwin-Schultz per-bar estimate ([CS] to 1e-9 against HALF_PUB / HALF_PB); the execution bounds and participation; INV and U sizing with a within-name weight permutation null. Every line is an OHLC estimator; D336 (quoted spreads) is not pre-empted. Nothing is a book; nothing promoted.",
